WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.825
Same protons, same element. Different neutrons, different isotope.

2
00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:09.301
Carbon twelve: six protons, six neutrons, stable.

3
00:00:11.106 --> 00:00:14.681
One more neutron: carbon thirteen, still stable.

4
00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:20.678
Another: carbon fourteen. Still carbon, but radioactive.

5
00:00:21.205 --> 00:00:25.205
Same protons, different neutrons: isotopes of carbon.
